1
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:42,900
My Lord.

2
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:45,260
Oh no,

3
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,600
I entered the wrong place.

4
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,560
What should I do?

5
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:53,230
I'm actually not here for the girls.

6
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:56,200
That explanation sounds even worse.

7
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:09,230
So he has a new target.

8
00:01:09,830 --> 00:01:10,360
Wait,

9
00:01:10,930 --> 00:01:12,390
why does he look familiar?

10
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:15,560
Mister!

11
00:01:20,730 --> 00:01:21,500
My Lord,

12
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:23,530
we have all kinds of girls here.

13
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:24,360
Look.

14
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,530
No need.

15
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:26,530
Move.

16
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:29,160
Uh, okay.

17
00:01:38,330 --> 00:01:40,060
Um, Mister,

18
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:41,560
listen to my explanation.

19
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:44,630
Hey, Mister,

20
00:01:44,630 --> 00:01:45,800
let me go!

21
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:51,060
So what are those two
making a scene here for?

22
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:53,729
That little lord just said

23
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:55,759
he wasn't interested in girls.

24
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,460
I know I was wrong, Mister.

25
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:27,900
I shouldn't have sneaked out of Yanmen.

26
00:02:31,530 --> 00:02:33,790
It seems you yearn for the outside world.

27
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,130
I happen to be going out,

28
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,860
so you can come along as my attendant.

29
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:45,560
Attendant?

30
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:53,260
Why do I have a bad feeling about this?

31
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:03,820
Looks like Madam is
going to suffer on this trip.

32
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,560
Mister,

33
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:19,000
thank you for bringing me to the market.

34
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,260
I told you I'm out on business.

35
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,300
Hmph,

36
00:03:23,530 --> 00:03:25,060
you don't mean what you say.

37
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:37,329
I

38
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:38,329
want this.

39
00:03:38,730 --> 00:03:39,760
Good eye, Miss.

40
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:42,000
Our sugar figures are crisp, sweet,
and don't stick to your teeth.

41
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:42,930
One coin each.

42
00:03:44,130 --> 00:03:44,930
Mister,

43
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,329
one rabbit,

44
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,260
one black fox.

45
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:03,430
Two in total.

46
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:05,560
Mister, do you want to eat too?

47
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:08,200
A long time ago,

48
00:04:08,730 --> 00:04:09,860
someone told me

49
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:12,100
that sugar figures only taste good

50
00:04:12,100 --> 00:04:14,030
when two people eat them together.

51
00:04:14,530 --> 00:04:15,860
Mmm, so sweet.

52
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:17,190
Mister, try it quickly.

53
00:04:20,459 --> 00:04:21,959
Still too sweet,

54
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,660
just like back then.

55
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:35,100
Mister, look,

56
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:35,960
a puppet show!

57
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:36,960
Let's go watch it.

58
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,560
Slow down, the show won't run away.

59
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:46,100
Okay.

60
00:05:07,030 --> 00:05:07,600
Master,

61
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:09,360
how can there be an inn

62
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,760
in the middle of nowhere?

63
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,000
Who cares?

64
00:05:12,460 --> 00:05:13,730
I'm starving to death.

65
00:05:13,730 --> 00:05:15,460
As long as there's food inside.

66
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:16,690
Let's go in and see.

67
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:29,960
Oh,

68
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,230
three guests.

69
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:32,860
Are you eating or staying?

70
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:40,290
Braised pork, steamed fish,
braised pork joint, osmanthus cake.

71
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:41,500
Anything is fine,

72
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:42,960
just make it quick.

73
00:05:48,030 --> 00:05:48,500
Master,

74
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:50,600
there's something wrong with this place.

75
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,560
I smell it.

76
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,600
The lingering scent of demons.
